            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"rag-tutor-notebook-2-document-chunking-duckdb-vector-store\">\ud83e\udd86 RAG Tutor \u2014 Notebook 2: Document Chunking &amp; DuckDB Vector Store</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">In Notebook 1, <code>ev-facts.txt</code> was already split into one neat sentence per line.\nReal-world knowledge bases contain multi-section Markdown guides, PDFs, and runbooks.\nIf you embed an entire 10-page document into a single vector, its meaning becomes blurry;\nif you slice it into tiny 30-character fragments, sentences lose their surrounding context.</span>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"1-interactive-document-chunking-overlap-lab\">1. Interactive Document Chunking &amp; Overlap Lab</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Adjust <strong>Chunk Strategy</strong>, <strong>Max Chunk Size</strong>, and <strong>Sliding Overlap</strong> below.\nWatch the <strong>Document Minimap</strong> to see how <strong>Markdown Section-Aware Chunking</strong> aligns cleanly with\nheading boundaries (<code>#</code>, <code>##</code>, <code>###</code>), whereas <strong>Fixed-Character Sliding Windows</strong> slice across sections\nand rely on <strong>amber overlap zones</strong> to preserve boundary context:</span>\n<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 2rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='MJUe-0' random-id='51f79ecb-e95c-c418-5874-45dfd982abac'><marimo-dropdown data-initial-value='[&quot;02_duckdb_vectors.md&quot;]' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eInspect Document:&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-options='[&quot;01_rag_fundamentals.md&quot;,&quot;02_duckdb_vectors.md&quot;,&quot;03_production_rag_patterns.md&quot;,&quot;04_advanced_graph_modular_rag.md&quot;]' data-allow-select-none='false' data-searchable='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-dropdown></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='MJUe-1' random-id='523ee690-47b7-4b4e-c5f4-ee06ea721d03'><marimo-dropdown data-initial-value='[&quot;Markdown Section-Aware Chunking (Recommended)&quot;]' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eChunking Strategy:&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-options='[&quot;Markdown Section-Aware Chunking (Recommended)&quot;,&quot;Fixed-Character Sliding Window&quot;]' data-allow-select-none='false' data-searchable='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-dropdown></marimo-ui-element></div>\n<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 2rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='MJUe-2' random-id='57b7ed3e-cd08-4d44-58d3-2bbfe0de4871'><marimo-slider data-initial-value='450' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eMax Chunk Size (characters):&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-start='150' data-stop='900' data-step='50' data-steps='[]' data-debounce='false' data-disabled='false' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;' data-show-value='false' data-include-input='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-slider></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='MJUe-3' random-id='79cebe6c-b293-a1b2-5dfc-15178d48913b'><marimo-slider data-initial-value='60' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eChunk Overlap (characters):&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-start='0' data-stop='200' data-step='20' data-steps='[]' data-debounce='false' data-disabled='false' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;' data-show-value='false' data-include-input='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-slider></marimo-ui-element></div>\n\n<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 2rem'><div style='flex: 1'><marimo-stat data-value='&quot;8&quot;' data-label='&quot;Chunks Generated&quot;' data-caption='&quot;Source: 02_duckdb_vectors.md (2847 chars)&quot;' data-bordered='true' data-target_direction='&quot;increase&quot;'></marimo-stat></div><div style='flex: 1'><marimo-stat data-value='&quot;377 chars&quot;' data-label='&quot;Average Chunk Size&quot;' data-caption='&quot;Target max: 450 chars&quot;' data-bordered='true' data-target_direction='&quot;increase&quot;'></marimo-stat></div><div style='flex: 1'><marimo-stat data-value='&quot;180 chars (6.3%)&quot;' data-label='&quot;Total Overlap Context&quot;' data-caption='&quot;Window overlap = 60 chars&quot;' data-bordered='true' data-target_direction='&quot;increase&quot;'></marimo-stat></div></div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#0f172a;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #334155;color:#f8fafc;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;\">\ud83d\udccf Document Chunking Minimap & Overlap Visualizer (Markdown Section-Aware)</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"color:#94a3b8;\">\u25cf Dashed Vertical Lines = Markdown Headings</span> \u00b7 <span style=\"color:#f59e0b;\">\u2588 Amber Highlights = Sliding Overlap Zones</span></span></div><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;\"><svg width=\"660\" height=\"236\" viewBox=\"0 0 660 236\" style=\"background:#020617;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #1e293b;width:100%;max-width:660px;\">