          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"2-graduating-from-python-lists-to-duckdb-float128\">2. Graduating from Python Lists to DuckDB (<code>FLOAT[128]</code>)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">All <strong>48 chunks</strong> across the 4 Markdown guides in <code>data/sample_docs/</code> are now\nembedded and stored in a <strong>DuckDB</strong> table (<code>rag_chunks</code>) with fixed-size <code>FLOAT[128]</code> vectors:</span>\n<div class=\"language-sql codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">CREATE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">TABLE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rag_chunks</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">chunk_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">INTEGER</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">PRIMARY</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">KEY</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">doc_source</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">VARCHAR</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">section_title</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">VARCHAR</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">chunk_text</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">VARCHAR</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">char_length</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">INTEGER</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">department</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">VARCHAR</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">updated_year</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">INTEGER</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">embedding</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">FLOAT</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">128</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"live-vector-search-in-duckdb-sql-array_cosine_similarity\">Live Vector Search in DuckDB SQL (<code>array_cosine_similarity</code>)</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-ui-element object-id='lEQa-0' random-id='bf8f10f1-bc78-8891-35d7-b981b5550d3f'><marimo-text data-initial-value='&quot;How do I store fixed-size float embeddings and compute cosine similarity in DuckDB?&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eSearch the DuckDB &#92;u003ccode&#92;u003erag_chunks&#92;u003c/code&#92;u003e table via &#92;u003ccode&#92;u003earray_cosine_similarity&#92;u003c/code&#92;u003e:&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-kind='&quot;text&quot;' data-full-width='true' data-disabled='false' data-debounce='true'></marimo-text></marimo-ui-element>\n<marimo-ui-element object-id='lEQa-1' random-id='7ba4f261-0f55-fd0f-4e7c-50c844896091'><marimo-slider data-initial-value='4' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eTop K (&#92;u003ccode&#92;u003eLIMIT&#92;u003c/code&#92;u003e):&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-start='1' data-stop='8' data-step='1' data-steps='[]' data-debounce='false' data-disabled='false' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;' data-show-value='false' data-include-input='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-slider></marimo-ui-element></span>\n<div style=\"background:#0f172a;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #334155;color:#f8fafc;margin:8px 0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;\">\ud83d\udcca DuckDB Cosine Similarity Ranking (Top-4 Results)</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#cbd5e1;\"></span></div><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;\"><div style=\"background:#020617;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #1e293b;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"color:#f8fafc;font-family:monospace;\"><strong>#1</strong> \u00b7 <code>02_duckdb_vectors.md</code> &gt; <strong>Vector &amp; Full-Text Search with DuckDB</strong> (Chunk #12)</span><span style=\"color:#2dd4bf;font-family:monospace;font-weight:700;\">vector_score = 0.7356</span></div><div style=\"background:#1e293b;height:8px;border-radius:4px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"width:73.6%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0284c7,#2dd4bf);height:100%;border-radius:4px;\"></div></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;margin-top:5px;\"># Vector &amp; Full-Text Search with DuckDB</div></div><div style=\"background:#020617;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #1e293b;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"color:#f8fafc;font-family:monospace;\"><strong>#2</strong> \u00b7 <code>02_duckdb_vectors.md</code> &gt; <strong>2. Storing Fixed-Size Embeddings in DuckDB (Part 1)</strong> (Chunk #14)</span><span style=\"color:#2dd4bf;font-family:monospace;font-weight:700;\">vector_score = 0.6527</span></div><div style=\"background:#1e293b;height:8px;border-radius:4px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"width:65.3%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0284c7,#2dd4bf);height:100%;border-radius:4px;\"></div></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;margin-top:5px;\">## 2. Storing Fixed-Size Embeddings in DuckDB DuckDB natively supports fixed-size `FLOAT[N]` array columns. For example, if your embedding mod...</div></div><div style=\"background:#020617;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #1e293b;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"color:#f8fafc;font-family:monospace;\"><strong>#3</strong> \u00b7 <code>04_advanced_graph_modular_rag.md</code> &gt; <strong>1. Stage 1: Parallel Retrieval Techniques (Part 4)</strong> (Chunk #39)</span><span style=\"color:#2dd4bf;font-family:monospace;font-weight:700;\">vector_score = 0.6223</span></div><div style=\"background:#1e293b;height:8px;border-radius:4px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"width:62.2%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0284c7,#2dd4bf);height:100%;border-radius:4px;\"></div></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;margin-top:5px;\">partment`, `author`, `updated_year`, or access-control tier) before or alongside vector similarity search. In **DuckDB**, a SQL `WHERE` clause...</div></div><div style=\"background:#020617;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #1e293b;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"color:#f8fafc;font-family:monospace;\"><strong>#4</strong> \u00b7 <code>01_rag_fundamentals.md</code> &gt; <strong>Phase A: Offline Indexing (Part 2)</strong> (Chunk #7)</span><span style=\"color:#2dd4bf;font-family:monospace;font-weight:700;\">vector_score = 0.6113</span></div><div style=\"background:#1e293b;height:8px;border-radius:4px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"width:61.1%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0284c7,#2dd4bf);height:100%;border-radius:4px;\"></div></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;margin-top:5px;\">e-en-v1.5`, which outputs a 768-dimensional float vector) to capture its semantic meaning in high-dimensional space. - **Storage**: Save both ...</div></div></div></div>\n\n<hr />\n<h3 id=\"interactive-duckdb-sql-playground\">Interactive DuckDB SQL Playground</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Pick a pre-built analytical recipe or write your own SQL query against <code>rag_chunks</code>:\n<marimo-ui-element object-id='lEQa-2' random-id='9bbaefec-628d-a9a6-84ab-829fca0dba30'><marimo-dropdown data-initial-value='[&quot;Recipe 1: Chunk Summary Statistics by Document (<code>GROUP BY doc_source</code>)&quot;]' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eLoad a DuckDB SQL Recipe:&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-options='[&quot;Recipe 1: Chunk Summary Statistics by Document (<code>GROUP BY doc_source</code>)&quot;,&quot;Recipe 2: Verify L2 Unit Normalization (<code>array_cosine_similarity(embedding, embedding)</code>)&quot;,&quot;Recipe 3: Filter Chunks Containing Specific Diagnostic / Pattern Codes&quot;,&quot;Recipe 4: Pairwise Chunk Similarity Matrix (Self-Join in DuckDB SQL)&quot;]' data-allow-select-none='false' data-searchable='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-dropdown></marimo-ui-element>\n<marimo-ui-element object-id='PKri-0' random-id='be1a7d59-5dda-0ae4-54c3-37e94fa9c104'><marimo-text-area data-initial-value='&quot;SELECT doc_source,&#92;n       COUNT(*) AS num_chunks,&#92;n       ROUND(AVG(char_length), 1) AS avg_chars,&#92;n       MIN(char_length) AS min_chars,&#92;n       MAX(char_length) AS max_chars&#92;nFROM rag_chunks&#92;nGROUP BY doc_source&#92;nORDER BY doc_source;&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eInteractive DuckDB SQL Playground (edit and run any SQL query against &#92;u003ccode&#92;u003erag_chunks&#92;u003c/code&#92;u003e):&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-debounce='true' data-full-width='true' data-rows='5'></marimo-text-area></marimo-ui-element>\n<strong>Status</strong>: \u2705 Returned 4 row(s)\n<marimo-ui-element object-id='Xref-0' random-id='ccce447a-1326-22bd-4c90-74771d47e936'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;doc_source&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;01_rag_fundamentals.md&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;num_chunks&#92;&quot;:11,&#92;&quot;avg_chars&#92;&quot;:309.7,&#92;&quot;min_chars&#92;&quot;:59,&#92;&quot;max_chars&#92;&quot;:448},{&#92;&quot;doc_source&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;02_duckdb_vectors.md&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;num_chunks&#92;&quot;:8,&#92;&quot;avg_chars&#92;&quot;:377.3,&#92;&quot;min_chars&#92;&quot;:39,&#92;&quot;max_chars&#92;&quot;:449},{&#92;&quot;doc_source&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;03_production_rag_patterns.md&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;num_chunks&#92;&quot;:15,&#92;&quot;avg_chars&#92;&quot;:369.9,&#92;&quot;min_chars&#92;&quot;:78,&#92;&quot;max_chars&#92;&quot;:448},{&#92;&quot;doc_source&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;04_advanced_graph_modular_rag.md&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;num_chunks&#92;&quot;:14,&#92;&quot;avg_chars&#92;&quot;:372.4,&#92;&quot;min_chars&#92;&quot;:55,&#92;&quot;max_chars&#92;&quot;:449}]&quot;' data-total-rows='4' data-total-columns='5' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row